els.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"This model accounted for repeated measures among doses reported by each registrant.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 2\", \"q\": \"the threshold for statistical significance was p<0.05.\"}, {\"loc\": \"table 1\", \"q\": \"Because few registrants reported a temperature that met the definition for fever, statistics were not estimated for this variable.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"SAS software (version 9.4; SAS Institute) was used for all analyses.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"outcome_types\", \"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}